# Cartofreako generated assets v13

This immutable object release mirrors the projection-organized generated-asset
bundle published with source release `@@SOURCE_TAG@@`. The source tag resolves
to commit `@@SOURCE_COMMIT@@`.

The release root is `cartofreako/v13/` in the Berkeley S3-compatible bucket
`adekosnik-bucket01`:

```text
cartofreako/v13/
├── tree/
│   ├── cahill-keyes/{svg,pdf,png,thumbnail}/
│   ├── authagraph/{svg,pdf,png,thumbnail}/
│   ├── dymaxion/{svg,pdf,png,thumbnail}/
│   ├── myriahedral/{svg,pdf,png,thumbnail}/
│   ├── star-x/{svg,pdf,png,thumbnail}/
│   └── voronoi/{svg,pdf,png,thumbnail}/
├── package/assets.generated.v13.tar.xz
├── README.md
├── viewer.html
├── SHA256SUMS
└── release.json
```

The recovery package contains @@SOURCE_TREE_FILES@@ files: 211 layered SVGs,
84 adjacent deterministic resource `.svg.gz` archives, 211 PDFs, 211
full-resolution PNGs, and 192 480-pixel-wide thumbnails—32 for each of the six
projections. The count explicitly includes every authorized Cloud-atmosphere
and standard Fiber Synthesized product in all four browser-facing formats.
The browser tree stores every SVG only as an explicit `.svg.gz` object, served
as `application/gzip` without `Content-Encoding`.

Selecting a thumbnail opens `viewer.html`, which fetches the same-origin
projection-specific `.svg.gz` object and streams it through
`DecompressionStream("gzip")`. The viewer also exposes compressed and
decompressed downloads. No uncompressed SVG is published in the browser tree.

All @@RELEASE_OBJECTS@@ objects are public-read and carry an immutable one-year
cache policy. `release.json` is the completion marker and is uploaded only
after every other object passes checksum verification. `SHA256SUMS` covers all
@@PAYLOAD_FILES@@ payload objects; it excludes itself and `release.json`.

The recovery package is byte-for-byte identical to the GitHub release asset:

```text
@@ARCHIVE_SHA256@@  assets.generated.v13.tar.xz
```

Project documentation and release notes are available at
<https://github.com/bdekoz/cartofreako/releases/tag/@@SOURCE_TAG@@>.
